      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've submitted a feature request there to possibly avoid this in the future: [Update yt-dlp to 2026.02.04 to resolve YouTube playback issues](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/update-yt-dlp-to-20260204-to-resolve-youtube-playback-issues)\n\nI suspect VRChat's older yt-dlp 2026.01.29 may be failing to solve YouTube's n/sig challenges correctly and therefore some users may be getting flagged as bots. yt-dlp 2026.02.04 changes the default JS video player to `tv` for n/sig deciphering.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
