  "details": "hi again, the advice i got from someone last time did not work, to nobody's surprise, until a few days ago when my video players started randomly playing again! awesome!\n\nand about 25 minutes ago, someone in an instance played a very LOUD video, so i force stopped it with the little square stop button, and since then, the ERRORS ARE BACK YAAAAY I LOVE NOT HAVING VIDEOS AGAIN!!!!!",
